# Canonical tour manifest dispatch (P15-P-B3)

## Problem

`apps/api/src/canonical/` still hard-coded Denali imports and `workspaceType === "denali"` branches for:

- publish-status audit labels (`atomic-canonical-tour-persist.ts`)
- publish transition detection (`tour-publish-transition-audit.ts`)
- `migrateCanonical` hook resolution (`migrate-canonical-hook.ts`)

Urban publish transitions lived inline in the API host instead of the workspace package.

## Manifest contract (`canonicalTour`)

Optional block on `workspace.manifest.json`:

| Field | Purpose |
|-------|---------|
| `publishStatusModule` | Package subpath for read/transition exports (usually `./tours`) |
| `publishStatusReadExport` | `(canonical) => string \| undefined` for audit metadata |
| `publishTransitionExport` | `(beforeData, afterData) => "published" \| "unpublished" \| null` |
| `migrateModule` | ACL module for batch migrate (Denali only today) |
| `migrateExport` | `migrateCanonical(schemaVersion, data)` |

Codegen output: `apps/api/src/canonical/workspace-canonical-tour-bindings.generated.ts`

Regenerate: `pnpm run generate:workspace-registry`

## Host dispatch

`workspace-canonical-tour-dispatch.ts` builds maps from generated bindings:

| Function | Used by |
|----------|---------|
| `readTourPublishStatusLabel(workspaceType, canonical)` | `atomic-canonical-tour-persist` audit metadata |
| `detectTourPublishTransition(workspaceType, before, after)` | publish transition audit + canonical persist |
| `resolveMigrateCanonicalHook(workspaceType)` | batch migrate jobs (not POST/PATCH — DEC-091 guard) |

Unknown workspace types return `undefined` / `migrateCanonicalNotImplemented`.

## Workspace packages

| Workspace | publish status read | transition detect | migrate |
|-----------|--------------------|--------------------|---------|
| denali | `readDenaliTourPublishStatusFromCanonical` | `detectDenaliTourPublishTransition` | `migrateDenaliCanonical` |
| urban | `readUrbanTourPublishStatusFromCanonical` | `detectUrbanTourPublishTransition` | — |

Urban transition uses `tour.publishStatus` / legacy `tour.status` (`published` vs draft).

## Verify

```bash
pnpm run generate:workspace-registry --check
pnpm run phase-15:platform-fast-gate
node --test apps/api/test/tour-publish-transition-audit.spec.ts
node --test apps/api/test/workspace-canonical-tour-dispatch.spec.ts
rg -c 'workspaceType === "denali"' apps/api/src/canonical
```
